  """Launch the bundled Scuzz IDE (`[ui]` package in the SDK)

Usage: scuzz ide [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  [default: .]

Options:
      --target <TARGET>
          Platform to run: linux, macos, headless, android, or ios (same rules as `scuzz run`)
      --out-dir <OUT_DIR>
          [default: build]
      --message-format <MESSAGE_FORMAT>
          Diagnostic format: human (default) or json (`scuzz check` only) [default: human] [possible values: human, json]
  -h, --help
          Print help

Examples:
